<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><body><div class="eli-subdivision" id="art_51">
                  <p id="d1e6041-1-1" class="oj-ti-art">Article 51</p>
                  <div class="eli-title" id="art_51.tit_1">
                     <p class="oj-sti-art">Identification of beneficial owners for legal entities</p>
                  </div>
                  <p class="oj-normal">Beneficial owners of legal entities shall be the natural persons who:</p>
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                     <col width="4%" />
                     <col width="96%" />
                     <tbody>
                        <tr>
                           <td valign="top">
                              <p class="oj-normal">(a)</p>
                           </td>
                           <td valign="top">
                              <p class="oj-normal">have, directly or indirectly, an ownership interest in the corporate entity; or</p>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                     <col width="4%" />
                     <col width="96%" />
                     <tbody>
                        <tr>
                           <td valign="top">
                              <p class="oj-normal">(b)</p>
                           </td>
                           <td valign="top">
                              <p class="oj-normal">control, directly or indirectly, the corporate or other legal entity, through ownership interest or via other means.</p>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <p class="oj-normal">Control via other means as referred to in the first paragraph, point (b), shall be identified independently of and in parallel to the existence of an ownership interest or control through ownership interest.</p>
               </div>
               </body></html>